"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"1. Personal history of stroke, brain lesions, previous neurosurgery, any personal history of seizure or fainting episode of unknown cause, or head trauma resulting in loss of consciousness, lasting over 30 minutes or with sequela lasting longer than two days.\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"2. First-degree family history of any neurological disorder with a potentially hereditary basis, including migraines, epilepsy, or multiple sclerosis.\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"3. Cardiac pacemakers, neural stimulators, implantable defibrillator, implanted medication pumps, intracardiac lines, or acute, unstable cardiac disease, with intracranial implants (e.g. aneurysm clips, shunts, stimulators, cochlear implants, or electrodes) or any other metal object within or near the head that precludes MRI scanning.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"4. Noise-induced hearing loss or tinnitus.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"5. Current use (any use in the past 4 weeks, chronic use within 6 past six months) of any investigational drug or of any medications with psychotropic, anti or pro-convulsive action.\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"6. Lifetime history of major depressive disorder, schizophrenia, bipolar disorder, mania, or hypomania.\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"7. Meet current DSM V criteria for moderate to severe substance use disorder (excluding nicotine), smoke daily, or urine toxicology positive for any illicit substance inconsistent with history given.\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"8. Have met DSM V criteria for moderate to severe substance use disorder (excluding nicotine, alcohol and cannabis) in the past, or have met DSM V criteria for moderate to severe substance use disorder for cannabis or alcohol in the past 5 years.\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"OR\": {\n                                        \"left\": {\n                                          \"raw_text\": \"9. History of myocardial infarction, angina, congestive heart failure, cardiomyopathy, stroke or transient ischemic attack, or any heart condition currently under medical care.\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"OR\": {\n                                            \"raw_text\": \"10. Pregnant women or women with reproductive potential who are sexually active and not using an acceptable form of contraception.\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                \"raw_text\": \"11. History of learning disability or current ADHD.\"\n                                                },\n                                                \"right\": {\n                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                    \"raw_text\": \"12. Participation in an rTMS session less than two weeks ago.\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                        \"raw_text\": \"Screening tools: TMS adult safety questionnaire, Medical History. 2. Screening tool: TMS adult safety screening, MRI safety screening, Medical History. 4. Screening tools: TMS adult safety screening. 5. Screening tools: MRI safety screening questionnaire, Medical history, Medical Assessments: Urine toxicology analyzes for presence of a broad range of prescription and nonprescription drugs. 6. Screening tools: SCID Screen Patient Questionnaire. Potential diagnoses will be further evaluated by a counsellor. 7. Screening tools: SCID Screen Patient Questionnaire. Potential diagnoses will be further evaluated by a counsellor, Drug Use Survey (DUS), Substance Use Disorder Evaluation, Medical Assessments: urine qualitative drug screen is performed for methadone, benzodiazepines, cocaine, amphetamine/methamphetamine, opiates, barbiturates, and tetrahydrocannabinol. 8. Screening tools: SCID Screen Patient Questionnaire. Potential diagnoses will be further evaluated by a counselor. Drug Use Survey (DUS), Substance Use Disorder Evaluation. 9. Screening tool: physical assessment (EKG), medical history. 10. Screening tool: Medical assessments (urine pregnancy test) at the beginning of each visit that involves TMS or MRI. 11. Screening tool: Wechsler Abbreviated Scale of Intelligence, Medical history, Adult ADHD Self-Report Scale. 12. Screening tool: TMS safety screening questionnaire.\"\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"